      "text": " I think I'm gonna call her Bella."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:20.979",
      "start": "00:00:16.975",
      "text": " We played ball, and we played Don't You Shoes."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:21.980",
      "start": "00:00:20.979",
      "text": " Don't you shoes?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:23.982",
      "start": "00:00:21.980",
      "text": " That one was his favorite."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:26.985",
      "start": "00:00:24.983",
      "text": " Bella is just snow."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:30.989",
      "start": "00:00:27.986",
      "text": " I had a great family and a place to call home."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:35.994",
      "start": "00:00:33.992",
      "text": " Squirrel, squirrel, squirrel!"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:38.997",
      "start": "00:00:37.996",
      "text": " I was lost."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:39.998",
      "start": "00:00:38.997",
      "text": " It was a duck."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:41.959",
      "start": "00:00:40.999",
      "text": " Looks like she needs help."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:44.962",
      "start": "00:00:42.960",
      "text": " And a long way from home."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:45.963",
      "start": "00:00:44.962",
      "text": " What's your name?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:46.964",
      "start": "00:00:45.963",
      "text": " Sophie, Sadie."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:47.965",
      "start": "00:00:46.964",
      "text": " Bella."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:49.967",
      "start": "00:00:47.965",
      "text": " Bella, who's up on?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:00:51.969",
      "start": "00:00:50.968",
      "text": " No!"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:01.979",
      "start": "00:00:56.974",
      "text": " The world was far bigger and more uncertain than I could ever imagine."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:01:05.983",
